    "response": "To check your account balance in the VinBank mobile app, follow these steps:\n\n1. **Open the VinBank app** on your smartphone\n2. **Log in** using your username/email and password (or biometric authentication if enabled)\n3. Navigate to the **\"Accounts\"** or **\"My Accounts\"** section\n4. Select the account you want to check (checking, savings, etc.)\n5. The current balance will be displayed prominently on the account overview screen\n\nIf you're having trouble accessing your balance or see an error message, please let me know and I can help troubleshoot further. You can also contact our support team for additional assistance with the app interface.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with regarding your account?",
