    "input": "How do I activate a credit card?",
    "response": "To activate your credit card with VinBank, you can follow these steps:\n\n1. **Visit a VinBank Branch** – Go to any of our physical branches where our staff will assist you directly.\n\n2. **Submit Activation Request** – Provide your identification documents (ID, passport, etc.) and the credit card application form.\n\n3. **Card Issuance** – Once approved, we'll issue your credit card. You may choose between:\n   - **In-store pickup** – Available immediately after approval\n   - **Mail delivery** – Shipped to your registered address\n\n4. **Activation Process** – After receiving your card, you'll need to:\n   - Call the customer service number to activate the card online via our mobile app/website\n   - Or visit a branch to complete the activation\n\n5. **Set Up Security Features** – Enable features like:\n   - Card locking/unlocking\n   - PIN setup (if applicable)\n   - Virtual card numbers for additional security\n\n**Important Notes:**\n- Your card will be activated electronically once it arrives in your possession\n- Make sure you have a stable internet connection if using the mobile app for activation\n- Keep your activation confirmation email for future reference\n\nIf you've already applied but haven't received your card yet, or if you need assistance with an existing application, please let me know and I can help guide you through the next steps. Would you like to proceed with activating an existing application or start a new one?",
